摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH（DeepSeek Harness）流程图管理插件：浏览 Archify 业务流程图目录、按 Git 附注标签阅读历史版本、保存版本。A workflow-diagram manager plugin for DSH.","id":"gh:1376659824","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"specdev-workbench","slug":"pioneer666-user/specdev-workbench","topics":["3d","dsh-plugin","skills"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH（DeepSeek Harness）流程图管理插件：浏览 Archify 业务流程图目录、按 Git 附注标签阅读历史版本、保存版本。A workflow-diagram manager plu"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" Harness）流程图管理插件：浏览 Archify 业务流程图目录、按 Git 附注标签阅读历史版本、保存版本。A workflow-diagram manager plugin for DSH."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# SpecDev Workbench"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Read your project's documents and diagrams, then make a room you can walk through, read in and share"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ead your project's documents and diagrams, then make a room you can walk through, read in and share."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"SpecDev Workbench is a plugin for **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**, an AI agent workspace. It combines a c"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"onventional document and Archify diagram reader with furnished 3D rooms. Ask the AI to arrange a for"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"est reading cabin or ceramic workspace around your materials, enjoy rain and ambient sound, and expo"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"rt a room for others to explore."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"A “business” here means one feature or subject in your project, such as sign-in or a reading list. I"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ts registered materials can have an independent room."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Try the offline room** · **Install the plugin**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Download the HTML file and open it in a browser; this is a file download, not a hosted demo. The roo"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"m and selected documents/diagrams work offline. Source links still need a network connection and, fo"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"r private repositories, access permission."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## See the rooms"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Real screenshots of furnished sample rooms with fictional project materials:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"A forest cabin with warm wood, a reading area and decorations across the room."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"A ceramic room with glazed surfaces, translucent windows and separate work and display areas."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What you can do"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Understand a project.** Browse registered Markdown documents, interactive workflow and lifecycle"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" diagrams, node explanations and pinned source evidence. The regular 2D reader remains useful for fo"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"cused reading and historical snapshots.\n- **Make a place for its materials.** Ask the bundled AI ski"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"lls to arrange existing furniture using furnished layouts as a starting point. Choose forest or cera"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"mic, browse twelve furniture models, and describe your preferences in ordinary language.\n- **Read in"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"side the room.** Walk to a bookshelf, desk or notice board to open its bound materials, or use the c"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"omplete material list. Reading pauses walking; closing the reader returns you to browsing.\n- **Set t"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"he atmosphere.** Adjust brightness, rain, wet reflections and sound. Quick controls and display/weat"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"her/sound settings stay in sync. Sound starts only when you enable it.\n- **Share a room.** Export on"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"e HTML file containing the room and selected materials. Recipients can explore it without installing"},{"id":"p14s11","text":" DSH or this plugin."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The skills are written instructions that help the AI use the plugin's formats and validation tools. "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"They do not automatically turn source code into correct project documentation or guarantee that ever"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"y AI model will produce an attractive room."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install the plugin"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"You need **DSH installed and able to open a workspace** first. Start with the official DSH project a"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"nd its user documentation. This plugin's room, reading and export experience has been verified on **"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"Windows with DSH Desktop and Web 0.2.0-rc.2**; other hosts and platforms are not covered by that res"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ows with DSH Desktop and Web 0.2.0-rc.2**; other hosts and platforms are not covered by that result."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Current plugin version: **0.2.3** · Release and checksums · Exact npm version"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### First install: Windows Desktop"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Open DSH once to finish its initial setup. Save your work and exit through its menu or tray; confirm"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" the background instance has ended. Use that installation's bundled CLI. Keep the data root DSH alre"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ady uses: if you never set `DSH_HOME`, leave it unset. You do not need to build the plugin from sour"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" uses: if you never set `DSH_HOME`, leave it unset. You do not need to build the plugin from source."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Run this in PowerShell, replacing only the installation directory:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Open **SpecDev Workbench** in the sidebar. It appears in the central panel; **Return to chat** resto"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"res your conversation."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### First install: Web"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Finish the host's initial setup, then stop the Web instance. Use its own `dsh` CLI and the same data"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" the host's initial setup, then stop the Web instance. Use its own `dsh` CLI and the same data root:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Restart that instance. The sidebar entry opens the workbench in a new tab, keeping the chat availabl"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"e. For hosts launched through npm or a source checkout, see the matching CLI invocation in the insta"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"aunched through npm or a source checkout, see the matching CLI invocation in the installation guide."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Already installed?"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Back up your custom plugin configuration and record the installed package name before upgrading. Use"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" the matching Desktop/Web command above for the current npm identity. Reinstalling an already instal"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"led version can be skipped by the host; historical identities need separate migration care. Read upg"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"rades, local package installation and data roots before removing anything. Keep your existing projec"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"local package installation and data roots before removing anything. Keep your existing project data."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Your first room"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Compatibility and scope"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Rooms support floor furniture and one level of tabletop objects, arranged through AI-edited configur"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ation. In-page furniture editing, arbitrary scaling, wall mounting, nested supports, cross-room link"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"s and sitting animations are not available. Room validation checks placement and registered-material"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" readability; diagram compilation has its own validator."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Workflow and lifecycle diagrams are supported for authoring/registration. Sequence and other upstrea"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"m diagram types are not exposed as project materials. Old workflow reading and snapshots remain comp"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"atible; old projects and graphs are not automatically migrated."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Brightness, weather, sound and furniture visibility last only for the current page. Sound pauses in "},{"id":"p35s2","text":"the background and requires manual resume. Exported rooms start sunny and silent; sharing includes s"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"elected materials, not the whole repository or its history. Review sensitive text before sharing. Se"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"e the guide for full export limits and compatibility boundaries."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The current guides live on public **main**, added after the 0.2.3 release. The published 0.2.3 packa"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ge and tag retain their original README files and do not contain these guides."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Getting-started guide · Changelog · MIT license"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License and acknowledgments"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
